processing_purposes ||--o{ processing_legal_bases
processing_purposes ||--o{ consents
processing_purposes ||--o{ hipaa_authorizations
processing_purposes ||--o{ patient_objections
processing_legal_bases |o--o{ consents
consents ||--o{ consent_provisions
consents ||--o{ consent_evidence
hipaa_authorizations ||--o{ consent_evidence
treatment_informed_consents ||--o{ consent_evidence

note as LEGAL_MODEL
  LEGAL MODEL
  A processing decision evaluates: jurisdiction + controller/tenant + purpose +
  general legal basis + any special-category condition + restrictions/objections +
  authorization/consent when required. A consent row alone never grants blanket
  access. Policy and evidence versions are retained for historical reconstruction.
end note

note as POLYMORPHIC_SAFETY
  POLYMORPHIC SAFETY
  subject_type/subject_id and target_actor_type/target_actor_id are validated against
  closed value sets and system_ops.entity_registry. Orphan detection and immutable
  audit are mandatory.
end note


